  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In&nbsp;satellite&nbsp;telecommunication, a downlink is the&nbsp;link&nbsp;from a satellite down to one or more ground stations or receivers, and an uplink is the link from a ground station up to a satellite. Uplink frequency band for satellite communication is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>925</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>425</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>GHz</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>"
